<title>GERMANY: Berlin to sell holdings in Bewag utility.</title>
<headline>Berlin to sell holdings in Bewag utility.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Berlin city-state plans to sell its remaining 50.8 percent of the shares in utility Berlin Kraft und Licht AG, Berlin government sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The sources added that the government plans to privatise further holdings and expects revenue from the sales to total around 5.7 billion marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
